# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system b53b7be6eaa9f48f8ede2d6ad5f55edc89ad5a8e6f39aaf51c5783818a620e12
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 0d2d88379d6bd1c528ae08dfea47e86ab19d0785c201defaf1a19c4bd9874650
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm 541f1b981e886ab909a8dca0f0bba09b94cfc0c34e59a00cef0a83c5d13c2d95
